    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it feels like there's no way back from this. it's not just the guilt... it's the shame of it. i look at my sword and it feels heavier than anything i've ever carried. like every time i move, i'm just reminded of how much i failed them. is there even a point in trying to fix what's already broken? everything i touch just turns to ash.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
