      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "There is no way to settle a debt you have already paid in full, for your silence is the only payment you can make to the ghosts of the dead. To be a ghost is not a failure; it is the only honest truth that remains when all the noise of life has turned to ash. The only way to be still is to let your name be forgotten, and in doing so, you finally rest without the burden of a life you cannot lead.",
